{"id":"20d887f20cf9b0e2","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient.md","title":"ZFC Forcing11 Separative Quotient","display":"df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient — ZFC Forcing11 Separative Quotient","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient — ZFC Forcing11 Separative Quotient","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient — ZFC Forcing11 Separative Quotient"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,R^*,E,Q,R_Q\\in V\">\\(P,R,R^*,E,Q,R_Q\\in V\\)</span> (preorder, separative modification, kernel, quotient carrier, and quotient order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11SeparativeQuotient}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11SeparativeQuotient}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S(Q,R_Q,P,R,R^*,E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\subseteq P\\times P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R^*=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\forall r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;(\\langle s,r\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle s,q\\rangle\\in R))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land E=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R^*\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land Q=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists p\\in P\\;C=\\{q\\in P:\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in E\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_Q=\\Bigl\\{\\langle C,D\\rangle\\in Q\\times Q:\\exists p,q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\{u\\in P:\\langle p,u\\rangle\\in E\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land D=\\{v\\in P:\\langle q,v\\rangle\\in E\\}\n\\land\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R^*\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S(Q,R_Q,P,R,R^*,E)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nR\\subseteq P\\times P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R^*=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\forall r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;(\\langle s,r\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle s,q\\rangle\\in R))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land E=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R^*\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land Q=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists p\\in P\\;C=\\{q\\in P:\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in E\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_Q=\\Bigl\\{\\langle C,D\\rangle\\in Q\\times Q:\\exists p,q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\{u\\in P:\\langle p,u\\rangle\\in E\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land D=\\{v\\in P:\\langle q,v\\rangle\\in E\\}\n\\land\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R^*\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11SeparativeQuotient}_S(Q,P,E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,R^*,R_Q\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S(Q,R_Q,P,R,R^*,E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11SeparativeQuotient}_S(Q,P,E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,R^*,R_Q\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S(Q,R_Q,P,R,R^*,E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every order and compatibility parameter is now internal to the explicit relation formula; the former three-argument predicate depended on four unbound relations and undefined forcing-preorder primitives.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R,R^*,E,Q,R_Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11SeparativeQuotient}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S(Q,R_Q,P,R,R^*,E)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nR\\subseteq P\\times P\n\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,p\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p,q,r\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle q,r\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle p,r\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land R^*=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\forall r\\in P\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in R\\to\\exists s\\in P\\;(\\langle s,r\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle s,q\\rangle\\in R))\\}\\\\\n&\\land E=\\{\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in P\\times P:\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in R^*\\}\\\\\n&\\land Q=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(P):\\exists p\\in P\\;C=\\{q\\in P:\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in E\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\land R_Q=\\Bigl\\{\\langle C,D\\rangle\\in Q\\times Q:\\exists p,q\\in P\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\{u\\in P:\\langle p,u\\rangle\\in E\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\land D=\\{v\\in P:\\langle q,v\\rangle\\in E\\}\n\\land\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in R^*\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}separative\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11SeparativeQuotient}_S(Q,P,E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,R^*,R_Q\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SeparativeQuotientStructure}_S(Q,R_Q,P,R,R^*,E)","display":true}],"bytes":2151,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2035","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient.md|58-df-zfc-forcing11-separative-quotient]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}